        Buy</b></font></a></div>
    </td>
    <td bgcolor="#FFCCCC"> 
      <div align="center"><a href="http://161.246.6.111:8000/product/ViewFirstPage.jsp" target="_self"><font color="#0099FF" size="2" face="Comic Sans MS"><b>View 
        Buy Detail</b></font></a></div>
    </td>
